# ======================
# ⚠️ SECURITY NOTES
# ======================

# 1. NEVER commit .env files to Git
# 2. Change all secrets in production
# 3. Use strong, random passwords
# 4. Enable 2FA for all services
# 5. Rotate secrets regularly
# 6. Use environment-specific values
# 7. Keep dependencies updated

# ======================
# 🎯 UPGRADE PATH
# ======================

# Start with FREE services, upgrade as you grow:
# 
# At 1,000 users:
# - Keep everything free
# - Self-host on $20/month VPS
#
# At 10,000 users:
# - Upgrade Resend to Pro ($20/month)
# - Self-host Jitsi (included in VPS)
# - Still using Gemini (free)
#
# At 100,000 users:
# - Consider OpenAI ($50/month)
# - Move to AWS S3 ($50/month)
# - Upgrade to Twilio Video ($200/month)
# - Total: ~$400/month
#
# Still 40% cheaper than starting with expensive services!
